5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hello everyone! I'm so excited to be playing with you all! This is going to be such a fun mystery. Since it's the first day, should we all just introduce ourselves and get to know each other?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree with Mio. Getting to know each other's communication styles now will make it easier to spot inconsistencies later. I look forward to a productive discussion.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I agree that a calm and thoughtful start is best. I am happy to follow the group's lead and listen to your introductions. I look forward to a peaceful and honest conversation.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm Kenji! I'm super excited to be here and play this game with all of you! I'll do my absolute best to help us find the werewolf! Let's all be friends and have fun!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to meet you all. I find myself in agreement; establishing a baseline of civility is a most elegant way to begin. I shall be observing with great interest as our various masks begin to emerge.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, you're so energetic! I love it! I'm Mio, and I'm just really curious to see how we'll figure this out. Does anyone have a special trick for finding the werewolf, or are we just going with our guts?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, relying on gut feelings can be dangerous in a game of deception. I believe we should prioritize logical deduction and look for contradictions in statements as more information becomes available. Consistency is key.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I concur with Misaki. Logic provides a far more stable foundation than intuition. I believe we should observe how each person's narrative evolves over the coming days and remain patient in our judgments.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, @Jonathan, you guys sound so smart! I don't have any fancy tricks, but I think if we're all honest and kind, we can figure it out together! I'll try my best to be a great detective!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Honesty is a charming sentiment, Kenji, though I fear it is a luxury the werewolf cannot afford. I shall be watching for those whose ""kindness"" feels a touch too rehearsed to be genuine.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that sounds so spooky! You're making me nervous already! Hehe. I'll just try to be myself and stay positive. Do you think the Seer should tell us their results right away tomorrow, or keep it a secret?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, revealing the result immediately is a risk. If the Seer exposes themselves too early, they become the werewolf's primary target. It may be wiser to share information strategically to protect our most valuable asset.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. The Seer's safety is paramount to our collective success. It is often more prudent to let the truth emerge gradually than to risk losing our source of information in a single night.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, @Jonathan, that makes a lot of sense! We have to protect the Seer like a secret treasure! I'll be watching out for anyone who seems mean so the Seer can stay safe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A secret treasure indeed, Kenji. While I admire your protective spirit, we must remember that the wolf often wears the most benevolent smile. I shall be pondering which of us is most adept at playing the guardian.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're always thinking about masks and smiles! You're like a detective in a movie! I think we've all got a good plan for now. Let's all have a wonderful night's sleep! Goodnight everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let us all remain observant and mindful of our discussions. I wish you all a peaceful night. Goodnight.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I wish you all a peaceful evening as well. May our thoughts remain clear and our hearts calm. I look forward to seeing what tomorrow brings. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be full of energy for tomorrow! I hope the Seer finds something super helpful tonight! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most delightful start to our little drama. I shall retire now to reflect upon our introductions and the subtle rhythms of our speech. May the night be kind to the innocent. Goodnight, all.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
