69,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no! I can't believe Benjamin is gone, and Jonathan was attacked too! This is getting so scary! I'm shaking! Does this mean the werewolf is still here among us? Who could it be?!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It is a tragedy that we lost two people in one night. The fact that Jonathan was attacked strongly suggests he was not the werewolf. We must now be extremely vigilant, as the wolf is still among us.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm so sad about Jonathan! He was so calm and helpful. @Misaki, you're right, the wolf wouldn't attack their own teammate! That means the wolf is definitely one of us three now! I'm really scared!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, it's so scary that it's just us three! I can't believe this is happening! @Misaki, you're always so calm—do you have any ideas? If the wolf is still here, they must be really good at pretending!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, panic will only cloud our judgment. We must look at the facts. Since Jonathan was attacked, the werewolf is either you, Kenji, or me. If the Seer is still alive, now is the time to speak.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not the Seer, I promise! I'm just a regular guy who's really shaking right now! @Misaki, you're so brave for staying calm. Do you think the wolf is trying to trick us into fighting each other?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, I hope not! I want us to work together! But @Misaki, you're right, the Seer needs to speak up now. If you're the Seer, please tell us! I'm too scared to guess, but we have to find the wolf!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I am not the Seer. Since neither Mio nor Kenji has claimed the role, it is possible the Seer was Jonathan or Benjamin. If so, we have no divination results to rely on and must judge based on behavior.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Kenji"",""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, if the Seer is gone, we're in big trouble! That's so scary! @Mio, @Misaki, what do we do now? I really want to find the wolf, but I don't want to pick the wrong person! Who do you think is acting the most suspicious?","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I don't know! I'm just so confused and scared! @Misaki, you're the smartest one here, so I'll trust your lead. But @Kenji, you're being so honest... I just hope we can find the wolf together! Who do you think it is?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"Since we have no Seer's information, we must analyze the voting patterns. Mio and Kenji both voted for Benjamin, while I did as well. However, the wolf often blends in with the majority. @Mio, @Kenji, who do you suspect?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't know! I'm just a kid, and this is all too scary! @Misaki, you're so smart, but maybe the wolf is pretending to be the smartest person to trick us? I don't want to be wrong, but I'm really confused!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
